{{!-- Ideatrium primary logo (FD-139), drawn from the #ideatrium-logo symbol (icons/logo-symbols,
in the header partial of every page). Brackets and lettering take the parent's colour (set to
--logo-ink), the idea squares --logo-accent. Always decorative here: the link or text around it
carries the name. Fixed width and height from the viewBox ratio (495 : 72), so nothing moves
when the fonts swap (FD-65). Default 24 px tall. --}}
<svg class="logo{{#if class}} {{class}}{{/if}}" viewBox="0 0 495 72" width="{{#if width}}{{width}}{{else}}165{{/if}}" height="{{#if height}}{{height}}{{else}}24{{/if}}" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#ideatrium-logo" /></svg>
